# Lab-local ignore rules. The repo root .gitignore already covers *.safetensors / *.gguf / *.bin /
# *.pt, but it does not know about downloaded repositories or parquet shards, and this lab is
# explicitly forbidden from committing weights or datasets.

# `hf download` output: model weights, tokenizers, dataset parquet/TSV shards.
hf-cache/

# Runtime dataset copies, if you ever point the harness at a local path instead.
data/

# Ablated-model output: a model with the refusal behaviour removed — a weaponised artefact that
# must never be published.
out/

# Local scratch produced by the harness.
*.jsonl
*.log